-- IELTS 5.0: more lessons per skill. Reading goes from 2 to 8 lessons, Listening from 2 to 8 and Writing from 8 to 10, in
-- new chặng that build on the first ones. Every new point has a lesson, a practice set of three questions, and every new
-- chặng has a final test. Listening reuses recorded audio with new questions that follow its transcript.

-- New chặng.

-- New points and their prerequisites.

-- Reading.

Last month the city opened bus route 12, which links the railway station with the new hospital. Before the route opened, patients had to take two buses, and the journey often took an hour. Now it takes twenty minutes. The buses run every ten minutes from six in the morning until eleven at night, and the fare is one pound fifty. Some residents asked for a night service as well, but the council says it will wait for the first year''s figures.', 'VALID');
