Kasia opened her bakery in the old market street in March. She makes all the bread herself, starting at four every morning. Her most popular product is a round loaf with seeds, which sells out by noon. At weekends she also sells cakes, and on Sundays customers can taste free samples. In the summer she plans to open a small cafe at the back.', 'VALID');
