The Chess Club meets on Tuesdays at six in room 4 and costs five pounds a term. The Film Club meets on Fridays at seven in the main hall; entry is free, but members bring their own snacks. The Walking Club leaves from the front gate on Sundays at nine and costs two pounds a walk. New members can join any club at the student office.', 'VALID');
