You do not need a garden to grow your own vegetables. Lettuce, herbs and tomatoes grow well in pots on a sunny balcony. Use pots at least thirty centimetres deep and fill them with fresh compost. Water the plants every morning in summer, but only twice a week in winter. Most herbs can be picked after about six weeks.', 'VALID');
